This `open-assets/sfx-generators/` directory contains `README.md` (MIT, hand-authored).

The SFX generator tools themselves (jfxr / Bfxr2 / ChipTone / rFXGen) are NOT
bundled in this prep pack; install them at your workstation using the URLs
in `README.md`. Each tool retains its own license — see `README.md` for the
source-by-source attribution:

- jfxr: BSD-3-Clause (Thomas ten Cate)
- Bfxr2: MIT (Stephen Lavelle / increpare)
- ChipTone output: CC0
- rFXGen: zlib (raysan5)